%% Sequence 04 — Submit evidence-linked skill review
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: assigned reviewer submits one review for an existing session.
%% Evidence status: Implemented.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor REVIEWER as Assigned reviewer
    participant C as «boundary» SubmitReviewController
    participant K as «control» SubmitSkillReviewCommand
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL
    participant E as «control» Adonis emitter
    participant L as «control module» review_listener
    participant F as «control» DetectAnomalyCommand

    REVIEWER->>C: POST ratings, observations and evidence
    activate C
    C->>K: handle(SubmitReviewDTO)
    activate K
    K->>D: Load session, reviewer assignment and existing review
    activate D
    D-->>K: Session, quorum and permission context
    deactivate D
    alt Reviewer and session valid
        K->>D: Create skill reviews, evidence links and update session progress
        activate D
        D-->>K: Transaction committed
        deactivate D
        K->>E: emit(review:submitted)
        activate E
        E->>L: Dispatch ReviewSubmittedEvent
        activate L
        L->>F: handle(reviewSessionId, reviewerId)
        activate F
        F-->>L: Anomaly check completed or flagged
        deactivate F
        L-->>E: Cache invalidated and listener completed
        deactivate L
        E-->>K: Event dispatched
        deactivate E
        K-->>C: Skill review records
    else Invalid assignment or session
        K-->>C: Policy or conflict error
    end
    deactivate K
    C-->>REVIEWER: Success/error response and review state
    deactivate C
